       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVREM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TOTAL-SECONDS PIC 9(6) VALUE 98765.
       01 HOURS PIC 9(3).
       01 MINUTES PIC 9(2).
       01 SECS PIC 9(2).
       01 REST PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DIVIDE TOTAL-SECONDS BY 3600 GIVING HOURS REMAINDER REST
           DIVIDE REST BY 60 GIVING MINUTES REMAINDER SECS
           DISPLAY TOTAL-SECONDS " SECONDS = "
                   HOURS "H " MINUTES "M " SECS "S"
           STOP RUN.
